{"v":4,"catch":"那些小混混會得到他們的報應的！\n女孩們的生命就靠你了！","desc":"《CRIME FIGHTERS》是由KONAMI於1989年發行的動作遊戲。\n滲透到一個黑暗犯罪團伙的基地，目的是營救一群被綁架的美麗婦女。\n用各種戰鬥動作和武器將壞蛋接連擊倒。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-03-18","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1712af1cb1cc0737f3d8b29c2f2af7a17cefdb7396b848042549eb56b9c15f5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fad6e6a6af9e1684f89a0acac47606efe6313e06b2b5ecb9b928d372229b4f23.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff03ba8e50da53b8c61f5afb31e13a96fd2a02e7fd30d0634d610c6eced8b5a8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b5e34cac2867a6882aeeb6d6c1aa40dc39a733d81be7e2538eec698517e130a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abbb5f8f31ea1bd9a886d00a564256ffcede429fa49bf73a42f4435a284fae54.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c9dafacd3ad31b6525d9c09faf962cd0b9918e99fe72620d73d4bad53d3ed347.jpg"],"titleId":"01002620141b6000","dlc":[]}